       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "12066189"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Acts as a chaperone to prevent the harmful aggregation of alpha-hemoglobin during normal erythroid cell development. Specifically protects free alpha-hemoglobin from precipitation. It is predicted to modulate pathological states of alpha-hemoglobin excess such as beta-thalassemia"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
  {
