       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "15931225"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Monomer. Forms a heterodimer with free alpha-hemoglobin. Does not bind beta-hemoglobin nor alpha(2)beta(2) hemoglobin A"
    }
   ],
